# @vercel/analytics and @vercel/speed-insights declare optional peer deps for every
# framework (svelte/vue/remix). npm 7+ speculatively resolves those optional peers and
# pulls in @sveltejs/kit -> vite@8, which conflicts with this project's vite@5 (vitest).
# We use none of those frameworks, so relax peer resolution to npm-6 behaviour. Vercel
# reads this file on build, so local, CI (npm ci) and Vercel installs all agree.
legacy-peer-deps=true
